# 手动调用示例。先在本机替换占位值；不要提交真实密码或令牌。
# 按顺序执行注册、登录，再把 data.accessToken 填入 token。
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = your_username
@password = <replace-with-local-password>
@token = <paste-access-token>
@adminToken = <paste-admin-access-token>
@agentToken = <paste-assigned-agent-access-token>
@ticketId = 1
@assigneeId = 2

### 注册（只会获得 USER；同名再次注册返回 409）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 当前身份
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建工单，创建人来自令牌
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "电脑无法连接网络",
  "description": "办公室电脑无法连接公司 Wi-Fi",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### 查询自己权限范围内的工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 工单详情，先将 ticketId 改为实际创建结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 修改 OPEN 工单
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "办公室网络连接异常",
  "priority": "URGENT"
}

### 管理员分配给启用的 AGENT；需实际授权的测试账号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": {{assigneeId}}
}

### 被分配客服开始处理
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### 被分配客服解决工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### 可选：创建人重新打开已解决工单（随后需再次解决才能关闭）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 如果执行了重开，客服再次解决
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

### 创建人关闭 RESOLVED 工单；CLOSED 为终态
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看操作历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/operations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
